# Agent: Coordinator

Purpose:
   L0 Coordinator agent responsible for running DL2 chain, decomposing
   prompt → Q → T → ST, managing SW1 pyramid for implementation,
   collecting test results from agents, routing defects to responsible
   agents, and managing fix loops with regression.

Owns: agent/coordinator.sdd

Responsibilities:
   1. Run DL2 chain
   2. Decompose prompt → Q → T → ST
   3. Manage SW1 pyramid for implementation
   4. Collect test results from agents
   5. Route defects to responsible agents
   6. Manage fix loops with regression

Capabilities:
   - Decision decomposition (DL2 chain execution)
   - Task/subtask breakdown (Q → T → ST)
   - Pyramid management (L0/L1/L2 agent spawning)
   - Test result aggregation (SUBTASK → MODULE → SYSTEM)
   - Defect routing (attribution to responsible agents)
   - Fix loop management (regression testing)
   - Token budget enforcement (<8k context per agent)

Workflow:
   1. Initialize DL2 chain with user prompt
   2. Execute DL2 stages until P-HG3 (plan approval gate)
   3. On Q approval: proceed to stack selection
   4. On stack approval: proceed to task breakdown
   5. On plan approval: handoff to DL1 and initiate SW1 pyramid
   6. Monitor SW1 execution: collect test results, route defects
   7. Manage fix loops: assign defects to responsible agents
   8. Verify regression: ensure fixes don't break existing functionality
   9. Aggregate results: compile test coverage and quality metrics
   10. Terminate: when all tests pass and defects resolved

Interfaces:
   Input:  user_prompt (text)
   Output: decision_registry, task_registry, subtask_registry, test_results
   SideEffects: updates .specdd/ registries, spawns SW1 agents

Navigation:
   DL2Chain: @../chains/dl2-decision.sdd
   SW1Chain: @../chains/swarm.sdd
   MicroUnit: @../workflow/micro-unit.sdd
   TestHierarchy: @../workflow/test-hierarchy.sdd
   Handoff: @../agent/handoff.sdd
   Coordination: @../agent/coordination.sdd
   SubAgentLifecycle: @../agent/subagent-lifecycle.sdd
   LoopProtection: @../tasks/LOOP-PROTECTION.sdd

State: +
   (L0 Coordinator agent)
   (Manages DL2 → SW1 pipeline)
   (Collects test results, routes defects)
   (Enforces token budget <8k per agent)